  "title": "Alinea Invest — How to Use an Investment App for Beginners: A Step by Step Guide",
  "summary": "To use an investment app as a beginner, download a regulated app such as Alinea, complete a short onboarding questionnaire about your goals and risk tolerance, link your bank account, and fund your account with any amount, even a few dollars. From there, choose an expert built portfolio or automated investing plan, set up recurring deposits, and check in periodically as the app manages the details. Most beginners are fully set up and invested in under 15 minutes.",
